## Environment

| | |
| --- | --- |
| DSH | `0.1.5-rc.2` |
| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-native-command` | `0.1.5-rc.2` |
| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-session-controller` | `0.1.5-rc.2` |
| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-deliverables` | `0.1.5-rc.2` |
