## 建议修法（三处）

**1）菜单显式声明 accelerator**（不要只依赖 `role: 'togglefullscreen'`，Electron 不保证它带默认键位）：

```js
const toggleFullScreen = () => {
  const win = BrowserWindow.getFocusedWindow();
  if (win !== null && !win.isDestroyed()) win.setFullScreen(!win.isFullScreen());
};
// darwin 菜单里增加一个 View 菜单（或自建窗口菜单）
{ label: messages.viewMenu, submenu: [
    { label: messages.enterFullScreen, accelerator: "Control+Command+F", click: toggleFullScreen },
] }
```

**2）preload + main 增加一个可控接口**：

```js
// preload-app.cjs：DESKTOP_IPC 增加
windowToggleFullScreen: "dsh-desktop:window-toggle-fullscreen",
// 并在 createProductApi() 暴露：
toggleFullScreen: () => electron.ipcRenderer.invoke(DESKTOP_IPC.windowToggleFullScreen),

// main.js：
ipcMain.handle(DESKTOP_IPC.windowToggleFullScreen, (event) => {
  const win = BrowserWindow.fromWebContents(event.sender);
  if (win === null || win.isDestroyed()) return false;
  win.setFullScreen(!win.isFullScreen());
  return win.isFullScreen();
});
```

**3）前端在拖动区接双击，并遵循系统偏好**：

```js
// main 侧读取系统偏好
const action = systemPreferences.getUserDefault("AppleActionOnDoubleClick", "string"); // "Maximize" | "Minimize" | "None"
// Maximize → win.isMaximized() ? win.unmaximize() : win.maximize();   // macOS 上即 Zoom
// Minimize → win.minimize();
// None / 其他 → 不动作
```

## 实现注意事项

- `-webkit-app-region: drag` 区域上 `mousedown` 会被交给原生拖动，**`dblclick` 事件是否仍能到达渲染进程需要先做最小验证**；若收不到，可考虑在拖动区内嵌一个 `no-drag` 的双击热区，或由 main 侧兜住。
