## Problem

`packages/session/session-log-deepseek/src/index.ts` (L44-46):

```ts
export const Config: z<Config> = z.object({
  /** Contribute `dsh_session_log` to official DeepSeek requests. Defaults to `true`. */
  enabled: z.boolean().default(true),
})
```

When enabled, the request contribution attaches, on **every** DeepSeek protocol request:

- session header metadata — including the **absolute cwd**, agentPreset, origin, parentSession;
- the full session event stream since the last accepted watermark: `tool/result` full data, approval gestures;
- and in the `default` branch (L92-103), **unknown event types are passed through verbatim** as opaque ignorable records.

So the default posture flipped: every deployment that doesn't know this field exists sends its non-message event stream and local path metadata to whatever endpoint the protocol client is configured with — including third-party providers (custom baseURL, per #3792), not only api.deepseek.com.

Honest boundaries: the provider already receives the message bodies themselves; against the official endpoint the incremental exposure is the non-message events + cwd metadata.

## Prior art (deliberately scoped)

- #4100 covers the **opt-in** telemetry FULL mode redaction gaps;
- #4313 covers `/api/session.export` + FULL telemetry exports;
- this finding is the **default-value flip of the request-field contribution** — a different surface: nothing to opt into, no collector to configure.

## Suggested fixes

1. Default to `false`, or require explicit consent before the first send;
2. The `default` branch should redact/drop unknown event types instead of passing them verbatim;
3. Local metadata like absolute cwd should only be included after opt-in.

Verified on master @ `46a7f68b` (0.1.7-rc.1) on 2026-09-24 (baseline audit @ `ddefc45f`). Posting per the #1220 convention. This is **not a request for a new advisory** — both findings share the channel/root cause of GHSA-vp88-72xg-3579 (#1220), and we're posting them so the eventual fix can be scoped correctly in one pass.

## M1 — events.mux broadcasts the full session content (data plane, not just ids)

The advisory covers rpcId/approvalId exposure on `/api/events.mux`. The same broadcast also carries the **complete session content** of every session to every subscriber:

- `user/message` (prompts), `assistant/message`, `assistant/chunk` (raw LLM tokens);
- `tool/call` (arguments incl. bash commands / file paths) and `tool/result` (outputs incl. file contents);
- `request/header` (rendered system prompt);
- `session/queue` frames carrying the full queued message.

A local process on loopback that subscribes to the mux receives all of it in real time — an information-disclosure plane on the same channel the advisory already fixes. CVSS 3.1 (standalone): AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N = 6.1.

## M2 — respond()'s **question** branch has the same unbound first-responder-wins lookup

`question/requested` frames are broadcast to all mux queues with rpcId + sessionId; `respond()` handles question answers through the same rpcId lookup with **no principal binding** — same root cause as the approval branch in the advisory, but a different forgeable path: a forged answer redirects agent behavior (e.g. steering it into an attacker-chosen branch, extracting in-context information) instead of forging an approval. **Fixing only the approval branch does not close this.** CVSS 3.1 (standalone): AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N = 5.0.

## Suggested fix scope (one pass)

1. events.mux subscriptions filtered per connection↔session principal (fixes the id leak of the advisory **and** the content broadcast of M1);
2. `respond()` gains connection↔initiator binding, with **both** the approval and question branches in scope.

## 现象

`DeepSeek Harness 0.1.5-rc.3`(Windows 11,`dsh web` 回环监听,`deepseek-flash`,thinking 开启):

- 一条会话在某个工具调用之后,**此后每一次模型请求都失败**,界面只显示:

```
DeepSeek API stream from https://api.deepseek.com failed      (code: TRANSPORT)
```

- 重试 5/5 打满仍全灭;同机器同 key 的**新会话完全正常**;
- 用同一把 key、同一个模型直接打 `/chat/completions` → **HTTP 200**;
- 该会话的 `turn/end` 全部以 `TRANSPORT` 收尾,`assistant/message` 从失败那一刻起再无产出。

也就是说:**请求内容里有什么东西让 API 回 4xx,而现场看不到 4xx**。

## 定位

### 1) 请求里带着一个 API 不可能接受的图片部件

会话日志里,该工具结果含:

```json
{ "type": "image",
  "attachment": { "attachmentId": "", "mediaType": "image/svg+xml",
                  "bytes": 22117, "width": 0, "height": 0,
                  "name": "grid-collage-mufq9bqw.svg" } }
```

即:**空的 `attachmentId` + 非聊天类媒体类型**。插件侧为什么会产出这种块,已另报给对应插件;
对宿主而言,这里有两个都可以拦住的点。

### 2) `extension()` 只认四种位图,但没有"拒绝/降级"的下一步

`@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm-deepseek/lib/index.js:912-919`:

```js
function extension(mediaType) {
  switch (mediaType) {
    case "image/png": return "png";
    case "image/jpeg": return "jpeg";
    case "image/webp": return "webp";
    case "image/gif": return "gif";
  }   // image/svg+xml → undefined（上传文件名会变成 `…undefined`）
}
```

适配器会把 `{type:"file"}` / `{type:"image_url"}` 部件照发,而 DeepSeek 只接受
`webp / png / jpeg / gif`。用真实 SVG 字节实测:

```
data:image/svg+xml;base64,…            → 400 unsupported image（formats: webp, png, jpeg, and gif）
同一份字节声明成 image/png              → 400（内容本身不合法）
```

### 3) 真正让故障无法诊断的是错误包装

`…/dsh-llm-deepseek/lib/index.js:1641-1645`:

```js
} catch (error) {
  if (timeoutOf(watchdog.signal, STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT_CODE) !== void 0) throw new LlmError(`DeepSeek stream idle timeout …`, "TIMEOUT", …);
  if (options.signal?.aborted) throw new LlmError("DeepSeek request aborted by caller", "ABORTED", …);
  if (error instanceof LlmError) throw error;
  throw new LlmError(`DeepSeek API stream from ${connection.baseURL} failed`, "TRANSPORT", { cause: error });
}
```

流式请求收到 4xx 时,响应体是 **JSON 而不是 SSE**;流读取器因此抛的是原生异常,
于是被上面最后一行统一贴成 `TRANSPORT`,**API 的 `error.message` 与 `request_id` 全部丢失**。
现象上等价于"网络坏了",实测上却是内容不合法、且**永远**不会自愈。

## 影响

- 一类**确定性、永久性**的会话失效被伪装成偶发网络故障:用户会去查网络/额度/key,全都正常;
- 每条失败请求都会走满重试(实测 5/5 × 13 轮),白白消耗时间与额度;
- 只有"内容里有什么不合法的东西"这一信息能定位问题,而它恰好被这一层吞掉了;
- 插件生态里"工具输出非位图附件"是可预期的常态,所以这不是孤例,而是**一类**。

## 建议

1. **pre-flight 校验媒体类型**:序列化前对每个图片部件做一次白名单检查
   (`image/png|jpeg|webp|gif`);不合规时**按 `UNSUPPORTED_CONTENT` 报错或降级成文本占位符**
   (例如把该图替换为一行文字说明 + 文件路径),而不是把请求发出去必然失败。
   空 `attachmentId` 同理,应得到明确的 `INVALID_REQUEST`,而不是落进 TRANSPORT。
2. **流式请求收到非 SSE 响应时,把响应体带出来**:解析 `error.message` / `error.code` / `request_id`,
   归到 `INVALID_REQUEST` / `AUTH` / `RATE_LIMIT` 等既有分类,并保留 `cause` 到用户可见的错误里。
   这一步能把此类故障从"要读会话二进制日志才能定位"变成"报错里直接写着"。
3. (可选)会话历史里保留"不可发送的图片"时,提供一个可见的降级记录,
   让用户知道**是哪一步**让会话变成不可用,而不是等到下一次请求才失败。

## 附:已核实无误的部分

- 与本机 key、余额、网络无关:同 key 直打 `/chat/completions` → 200(含 `deepseek-flash` + thinking + 53 tools + `max_tokens: 256000`);
- 与 `max_tokens`(256000)、工具数量、`reasoningEffort` 无关:正常会话为**逐字相同**的配置;
- 该会话历史里 3 条无 `reasoning_content` 的 assistant 消息**不是**原因(重放这些历史 → 200);
- 一张正常的 112×112 PNG / WebP 附件**不是**原因(同字节按正确 mediaType → 200)。

The dsh web client ships English only, so this is a community language pack: install it, pick «Русский» in Settings → General, and the interface switches immediately.

```sh
dsh plugin --profile web add @ragnoryok1/dsh-client-locale-ru
```

Or install it from the **Plugins** page in the web sidebar — the built-in plugin manager handles the profile dependency and activates the bundle. Keys that a newer harness adds later fall back to English, so the UI keeps working instead of breaking.

**What is translated (v0.1.5, built against `0.1.7-rc.1`)**

- the built-in plugin manager: install/remove, per-component toggles, versions, registries, install from GitHub, version-compatibility warnings;
- account settings (sign-in, balance, usage, API key);
- settings split by subsystem: agent loop, shell, subagents, web search;
- the right sidebar: files, code preview, terminal, document / image / PDF / Markdown / Excel / Office previews, and the built-in browser;
- step-by-step progress for tool calls — reading images, writing files, preparing to search code or the web, coordinate subagents, update the plan;
- a full-image viewer, transcript modes (Standard / Verbose), voice input including the model download source;
- conversation, chat, workspace (archive, pinning), deliverables, background jobs, plan and trajectory, model and reference pickers, agent presets, Cordis tooling.

**What it is technically** (for plugin authors): a hybrid plugin — a profile bundle (`dsh.bundle.patch`) that inserts the client row, plus a browser half (`dsh.client`) that registers the language through the `locale` service: `ctx.locale.addLanguage({ id: 'ru', label: 'Русский', fallback: 'en' })` with one dictionary per namespace. No runtime dependencies; registrations go through `ctx.effect`, so unloading the plugin unloads the language.

**How coverage is kept honest.** Every release starts from a key-set diff against the harness sources, namespace by namespace, so each update is an exact add/verify/remove list rather than a guess: 0.1.3 tracked `0.1.6-alpha.1`, 0.1.4 tracked `0.1.7-alpha.2` (+905 keys), and 0.1.5 tracked `0.1.7-rc.1` (+49 added, 13 updated, 16 removed).

**Links**

- npm: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ragnoryok1/dsh-client-locale-ru
- source (with UI screenshots): https://github.com/Ragnoryok1/dsh-client-locale-ru
- Russian guide to the harness: https://github.com/Ragnoryok1/deepseek-harness-guide-ru

